sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant SI as Sign-in page
  participant API as Auth API
  participant AUTH as Auth service
  participant DB as Application DB
  participant P as Portal
  U->>SI: Enter credentials
  SI->>API: POST credentials
  API->>DB: Load account by email + type
  DB-->>API: Account record + password hash + role
  API->>AUTH: Compare bcrypt hash
  AUTH-->>API: Password valid
  API->>AUTH: Sign JWT
  API-->>SI: User payload + httpOnly cookie
  SI->>P: Redirect by account type / role
  P->>API: Request protected data
  API->>AUTH: Extract session + guard
  API-->>P: Authorized scoped data
